          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Find numbers between 120 and 140 that are divisible by 8. Also find numbers between 1120 and 1140, and 3120 and 3140, that are divisible by 8. What do you observe?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.805,
            0.695,
            0.823
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. The numbers between 120 & 140 divisible by 8 are = 128, 136."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.832,
            0.735,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The numbers between 1120 & 1140 divisible by 8 are = 1128, 1136."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.859,
            0.735,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The numbers between 3120 & 3140 divisible by 8 are = 3128, 3136."
            }
          ]
        },
